      "id": "battle-wei",
      "section": "chapter-001",
      "block": "b-c35781bdeff07231cb61",
      "quote": "公至赤壁〖16〗，与备战，不利；于是大疫，吏士多死者。乃引军还，",
      "layer": "original",
      "section_title": "武帝纪第一",
